{
  "id": "poem-ba21d0930a06bab3dd7bfdbb",
  "title": "如梦令·小院春风不老",
  "author": "史浩",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "小院春风不老。",
    "鹊碧霓裳缥缈。",
    "雪脸间朱颜，各自一般轻妙。",
    "忒掉。",
    "忒掉。",
    "真个一双两好。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.8000.json#record-104",
